meta {
  name: GetStrongsOccurrences
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{url}}elberfelder/strongsOccurrences/strongs/:strongs?page=1&pageSize=50
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  pageSize: 50
  ~grammar: Kasus:nom
}

params:path {
  strongs: G0026
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  One row per occurrence of the (root) Strong's number, in canon order. Each row carries the original word as written plus
  the Elberfelder verse split into `before`, `keyword` and `after` token lists ({ text, matched }). The keyword spans the
  first to the last mapped Elberfelder word; words in between have matched=false. `keywordSuffix` is punctuation that
  trailed the keyword. Unmapped words have an empty keyword and the whole verse in `after`.

  Optional `grammar` (roadmap 0029.8): filter tokens only, one slot bound to this Strong's number; combines with book,
  rendering and paging, totals reflect the filter. G0026 with `Kasus:nom` returns 36 occurrences. 400 with the grammar
  problem body: `keyNotInLanguage` (G0026 with `Stamm:qal`; H1254 with `Stamm:qal` returns 39), `unknownKey` for a
  word token or a `dt.` filter, `unknownValue` / `ambiguousValue` for a bad value.
}
